LanguageData.MooGirl_BrainwashHelmet.description:
An advanced mind-control device developed by a space-age megacorporation, appearing as a tightly-fitted, fully enclosed helmet. Its interior emits specific light waves, visuals, and audio to deliver deep sensory stimulation and psychological suggestion, gradually eroding the wearer's self-awareness and reshaping loyalty.
During the brainwashing process, the Mugirl's pupils reflect intense light, her expression becomes stiff and dazed, and her breathing turns rapid, as if caught in a state of irrepressible pleasure intertwined with fear. If forcibly used on individuals from non-megacorporation factions, they will suffer mental breakdowns and frantically attack nearby creatures.
Removal requires a [Spacer Restraint Key], and after unlocking, the device can be further decoded using a [Restraint Decryptor].

The decoded helmet produces different effects depending on the wearer's status: for prisoners, each brainwashing session weakens their will to escape, with three sessions resulting in complete conversion to slavery;
for slaves, each session deepens their sense of suppression, with three sessions leading to total submission and elimination of escape desires;
for colonists, each session induces an eerie euphoria, with three sessions permanently altering their personality, preventing them from harming other pawns even during mental breaks.
